    <comment>What was withheld and what loading it would reveal. {0} is a count; the wording avoids a plural form the count would have to agree with.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MailBody.Notice.RemoteContentShown.Message" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Wczytano z obcych serwerów: {0}. Te serwery poznały Twój adres sieciowy oraz to, że wiadomość została otwarta.</value>
    <comment>What this reading of the message did fetch, said plainly rather than left to be inferred. {0} is a count.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MailBody.Notice.UndrawnImages.Message" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pominięte obrazy — zbyt duże lub zbyt liczne: {0}.</value>
    <comment>What of the message's own pictures was left undrawn. {0} is a count.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="MailBody.InfoBar.RemoteContent.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Zablokowano treść zewnętrzną</value>
